  "name": "TxAgent",
  "alternateName": [
    "Therapeutic Reasoning Agent"
  ],
  "description": "LLM-based AI agent for therapeutic reasoning that orchestrates 211 biomedical tools spanning drug databases, genomic repositories, clinical guidelines, and pharmacological resources. Generates personalised treatment plans, identifies drug interactions and contraindications, and supports multi-step reasoning across heterogeneous biomedical knowledge sources. Developed by the Zitnik Lab at Harvard Medical School.",
