  "mach:judgement": "Assess",
  "mach:judgementReason": "Highly capable therapeutic reasoning agent from a leading computational medicine lab (Zitnik, Harvard). Orchestrates 211 tools including drug databases, genomic repositories, and clinical guidelines — a significant breadth advantage over single-tool approaches. MIT licence, 617 stars, actively maintained. Not yet clinically validated in real EHR workflows, but is the most capable open-source agent for treatment recommendation research. Essential evaluation for teams building drug-interaction or personalised treatment pipeline agents.",
